# Grasping Shadows // Shadows' Lair. "Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains deathtouch and lifelink until end
# of turn. Put a dread counter on this enchantment. Then if there are three or more dread counters on it, transform it."
# A creature of Bot2's attacking alone in turn 4 (Bot2's Ornithopter, before the block) is not "a creature you control" and adds no counter.
# Turn 3: the Memnite attacks alone and gains both keywords (one dread counter); unblocked it gains 1 life. Turn 5: it has
# lost them (until end of turn, CR 514.2); blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter it kills the 0/2 with deathtouch (CR 702.2) and gains
# 1 life (two counters). Turn 7: with the Memnite and the Ornithopter attacking together nothing triggers (CR 506.5). Turn 9:
# the Ornithopter attacks alone, the third counter transforms it (CR 701.27a) and the counters stay on Shadows' Lair.
# Turn 11: {T}: Add {B}. Turn 13: "{B}, {T}, Remove a dread counter from this land: You draw a card and you lose 1 life" is
# refused with no {B}, then paid by a Mox Jet.

